  "name": "Qwen3-TTS",
  "description": "An end-to-end speech generation framework featuring discrete multi-codebook latent modeling and a dual-track hybrid streaming architecture. It employs custom 12Hz and 25Hz tokenizers for high-fidelity acoustic compression and supports multi-lingual synthesis, zero-shot voice cloning, and natural language-driven prosody control. The system achieves sub-100ms inference latency through a lightweight non-diffusion Transformer (non-DiT) architecture optimized for real-time interactive deployment.",
